<title>CHILE: Cristales unit raises capital by $6 mln.</title>
<headline>Cristales unit raises capital by $6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cristalerias de Chile said its Megavision television channel has increased its capital by $6 million.</p>
<p>The statement said 51 percent of the increase was subscribed by Cristalerias' CIECSA S.A. division with the rest taken up by the channel's other shareholder, Mexico's Grupo Televisa.</p>
<p>The company's ownership structure will not be changed by the capital increase, it added.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
